# Read by Workers static assets (wrangler consumes it; it is not served).
# The template sites moved from /template/<slug>/ to /templates/<slug>/site/
# so there is one noun and one tree for a template; the old index is the
# gallery now. Kept for the links, search results and shipped sites that
# still point at the old paths.
/template /templates/ 301
/template/ /templates/ 301
/template/:slug /templates/:slug/site/ 301
/template/:slug/ /templates/:slug/site/ 301

# /docs/ is the Developers page, so nothing here may redirect it: a rule for
# it would shadow the exported page on every hard load, which is how the
# overview was reachable only by in-app navigation for a while. The
# editable-templates reference lives on GitHub; tabbied-mcp 0.2.3 and earlier
# linked it here, at a page that never existed.
/docs/editable-templates https://github.com/tabbied-design/tabbied/blob/main/docs/editable-templates.md 302
/docs/editable-templates/ https://github.com/tabbied-design/tabbied/blob/main/docs/editable-templates.md 302
